 ("LUK.3.32", "des Sala", "literal", "Σαλὰ", None, ["des Salmon"], "Entspricht Salmon ([[RUT.4.20]]–[[RUT.4.21]], [[MAT.1.4]]–[[MAT.1.5]]); Treg und RP lesen Σαλμών (siehe Alternative)."),
